  "provenance": "Transcribed from Dream11's official point-system page (T20 tab) as archived by the Internet Archive on 2026-01-17 (the live page returned 'Server down' on 2026-10-12). Values reviewed line by line; not yet validated against real Dream11 match scores.",
  "notes": [
    "Official note: a player scoring a century only gets the century bonus (no 25/50/75 bonus). Lower milestones (25, 50, 75) stack.",
    "Official note: runs from overthrows count; an overthrow boundary gives no Boundary Bonus (Cricsheet marks these as non-boundary, which the ingest respects).",
    "Official note: a direct hit is by the only fielder to touch the ball; otherwise the last 2 fielders get 6 each. Cricsheet does not mark direct hits: one named fielder = direct.",
    "Official note: more than 3 catches still earns the 3-catch bonus only once.",
    "Wicket-haul bonuses (3/4/5) are applied highest-only here; the page does not say whether they stack. Check against a real scorecard.",
    "The same page has a separate 'TATA IPL' tab with different, older-style values (kept as config dream11-tata-ipl-tab-2026). Which one applies to IPL daily contests should be confirmed from real entered points (the review page compares both).",
    "Super Over events are excluded from all fantasy stats."
